---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section>
  <div class="vision-content">
    <h2>Our Vision</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>
      Omniversify is a movement derived from the theory of infinite coexisting
      realities. We exist to ensure our stories are seen, heard, and felt. We're
      building an extended version of Moroccan history to fill the gaps and
      create a full, comprehensive timeline without question marks. Through
      immersive games, we celebrate Morocco's multicultural legacy, amplify the
      Global South's silenced histories, and unite communities through shared
      creativity.
    </p>
    <p>
      For too long, Western narratives have reduced ours to footnotes or
      caricatures. We flip the script by promoting Amazigh Heritage and
      dismantling divisive myths, bridging cultures across the Maghreb through
      North African Unity, and illuminating stories textbooks ignore with Global
      South Solidarity. Our games are acts of resistance — blending history,
      fantasy, and cultural truth.
    </p>
    <blockquote class="highlight">
      "I'd be sure every time folks knew this version wasn't mine<br />
      which is why it is called 'His story'"<br />
      <cite>— Gil Scott-Heron</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .vision-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at 35% 35%,
      #8a7a3a 0%,
      #c2b067 50%,
      #8a7a3a 100%
    );
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .divider {
    width: 100px;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #c2b067, transparent);
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #c2b067;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .highlight {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: #c2b067;
    font-style: italic;
    border: none;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(194, 176, 103, 0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .highlight br {
    display: block;
    content: "";
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .highlight cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-style: normal;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .vision-content {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .highlight {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
